experience a light-hearted insight into everyday prison life with the added main objective of escaping!\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"The Escapists Game Trailer"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>A new, Ray-Winston-style voice for Team 17 Digital's new game: The Escapists!</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[null,null]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yq3bttMIbuI","title":"The Escapists Game Trailer","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/the-escapists-game-trailer.jpg","alt":"The Escapists Game Trailer","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"The Escapists Game Trailer"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>The Escapists Game Trailer</h2>\r\n<p>I seem to be carving out nice niche for voicing Game Trailers. Lots of incredible production companies are using my characters and Movie Trailer voice to add to the production. I respect the time an effort that goes in to making them so it's a pleasure to be the final touch on the project. The Escapists provides players the opportunity of experiencing a light-hearted insight into everyday prison life with the main objective being that of escaping!\r\nThe Escapists is available on Steam so go download it.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If your looking for a voice similar to The Escapists Game Trailer voiceover, or something else from my <a href=\"/character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Character Voiceover\">range of characters</a>, then please get in touch. I'm always more than happy to send a short voice a sample first to see if I'm right for your project.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L5",null,{"pageTitle":"The Escapists Game Trailer","pageUrl":"the-escapists-game-trailer"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L4","605",{"href":"/horlicks-promo-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/horlicks-promo-voice.jpg","alt":"Horlicks Promo Voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Horlicks Promo Voice"}]]}],["$","$L4","824",{"href":"/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voice.jpg","alt":"european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voice","className":"blog-rel